       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-RECORDS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

COPY "ACCOUNT-RECORD.cpy".
COPY "JOURNAL-RECORD.cpy".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    INITIALIZE ACCOUNT-RECORD
               JOURNAL-RECORD

    MOVE "0100000000001" TO ACC-NUMBER
    MOVE "A" TO ACC-STATUS
    MOVE "IRR" TO ACC-CURRENCY
    MOVE 1000000 TO ACC-BALANCE

    MOVE "20261107121500T0010001" TO JRN-STAMP
    MOVE "TX01" TO JRN-TRAN-CODE
    MOVE ACC-NUMBER TO JRN-CR-ACCOUNT
    MOVE 50000 TO JRN-AMOUNT

    DISPLAY "Account length: "
        LENGTH OF ACCOUNT-RECORD
    DISPLAY "Journal length: "
        LENGTH OF JOURNAL-RECORD
    DISPLAY "Account: " ACC-NUMBER
    DISPLAY "Balance: " ACC-BALANCE
    DISPLAY "Journal stamp: " JRN-STAMP
    DISPLAY "Credit account: " JRN-CR-ACCOUNT
    DISPLAY "Debit account: [" JRN-DB-ACCOUNT "]"

    STOP RUN.